return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-29T15:04:41+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-29T15:04:41+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A complete help desk and AI assistant that runs on your own WordPress: an AI that answers from your own pages with links, live chat, and support tickets in wp-admin, on a submit-a-ticket page and in the WooCommerce account area. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until a visitor opens it.'=>'一个运行于您自己的 WordPress 上的完整帮助台与人工智能助手：一个能根据您自己的页面内容并附带链接来回答问题的人工智能，具备实时聊天功能，并在 wp-admin、提交工单页面以及 WooCommerce 账户中心提供支持工单。在页面上占用不足 10 KB，且在访客打开之前不会发出任何请求。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Inbox'=>'收件箱','Tickets'=>'工单','Assistant'=>'助理','Settings'=>'设置','Setup'=>'设置','Zinn® Chat could not create its database tables:'=>'Zinn® Chat 无法创建数据库表：','The AI assistant could not answer a visitor:'=>'AI 助手无法回答访客的问题：','Fix it'=>'修复它','Loading…'=>'正在加载…','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'此屏幕需要 JavaScript。','Chat'=>'聊天','AI assistant'=>'AI 助手','Tickets and email'=>'工单与电子邮件','Site index'=>'站点索引','Privacy and spam'=>'隐私与垃圾邮件','Connect to Zinn Digital®'=>'连接到 Zinn Digital®','Show the chat on the site'=>'在网站上显示聊天','Nothing appears on the site, and nothing is loaded, until this is ticked.'=>'勾选此项之前，网站上不会显示任何内容，也不会加载任何内容。','Chat title'=>'聊天标题','Greeting'=>'问候语','The first thing a visitor sees.'=>'访客看到的第一样东西。','Greeting when nobody can answer'=>'无人应答时的问候语','Colour'=>'颜色','Text colour on the colour'=>'颜色文本颜色','Position'=>'位置','Bottom, end side (right in left-to-right languages)'=>'底部，末端（从左到右语言中的右侧）','Bottom, start side'=>'底端，起始侧','Offer "Talk to a person"'=>'提供“与人工客服对话”选项','Shown while somebody has the Inbox open and is not set to away.'=>'当有人打开收件箱且未设置为离开状态时显示。','Hide the chat from your support team while they are signed in'=>'在客服人员登录期间对他们隐藏聊天','Show "Powered by Zinn® Chat" under the chat'=>'在聊天下方显示“Powered by Zinn® Chat”','Optional. Off unless you turn it on.'=>'可选。除非您开启，否则处于关闭状态。','Let the AI assistant answer visitors'=>'让AI助手回答访客','Assistant name'=>'助手名称','Extra instructions for the assistant'=>'给助手的额外说明','For example: "Always mention our 30-day returns." They cannot override the safety rules.'=>'例如：“始终提及我们的 30 天退货政策。”它们无法凌驾于安全规则之上。','Answer language'=>'回答语言','"auto" answers in the visitor\'s own language; or a locale such as en_GB or de_DE to always answer in one language.'=>'“auto”以访客自身的语言回复；或指定如 en_GB 或 de_DE 的区域设置以始终使用单一语言回复。','Minimum relevance'=>'最低相关性','Passages scoring below this (0 to 0.95) are not used, and the assistant says it does not know. Check scores in the test console.'=>'得分低于此阈值（0至0.95）的段落将不会被使用，且助手会回复不知道。请在测试控制台中检查得分。','Offer a person after this many unanswered questions'=>'在收到这么多未回答的问题后向用户提供优惠','Longest answer (tokens)'=>'最长回答 (token)','Accept support tickets'=>'接受支持工单','Support page'=>'支持页面','The page with the [zinn_chat_support] shortcode or the Support page block. Ticket links in emails open this page.'=>'包含 [zinn_chat_support] 简码或“支持”页面块的页面。电子邮件中的工单链接会打开此页面。','Send team alerts to'=>'发送团队警报至','One or more email addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site admin email.'=>'一个或多个电子邮箱地址，以逗号分隔。留空则使用网站管理员邮箱。','Sender name on emails'=>'邮件发件人姓名','Email the team when a visitor waits for a person longer than (minutes)'=>'当访客等待人工服务超过（分钟）时向团队发送邮件','Private ticket links work for (days after the last message)'=>'私密工单链接的有效时间为（最后一条消息发出后的天数）','After that the page offers to email a new link.'=>'随后，该页面会提供通过电子邮件发送新链接的选项。','Add a Support tab to the WooCommerce account area'=>'在 WooCommerce 账户区域添加“支持”选项卡','Let the assistant tell signed-in customers about their own orders'=>'让助手向已登录的客户告知其订单信息','Answers "where is my order?" from the order status 