'客户可以在“我的账户”的“支持”下查看他们的工单，助手可以告诉他们订单在哪里。','Test the assistant'=>'测试助手','Ask it questions and see exactly which pages it answered from, including out-of-date ones.'=>'向它提问，并确切查看它根据哪些页面（包括过期页面）作出了回答。','Open the test console'=>'打开测试控制台','Answer live chats'=>'回复实时聊天','Visitors can ask for a person while you have the Inbox open. It works on a phone too.'=>'当您打开收件箱时，访客可以请求与人工客服对话。在手机上也同样适用。','Open the Inbox'=>'打开收件箱','Set up Zinn® Chat'=>'设置 Zinn® Chat','This site is connected to the Zinn Digital® app: chats are answered there. To run the help desk on this site instead, choose "This site" under Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.'=>'此网站已连接至 Zinn Digital® 应用：聊天信息将在该应用中回复。若要改为在此网站上运行服务台，请在“设置”下的“连接到 Zinn Digital®”中选择“此网站”。','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','Unlimited agents, with a Support agent role that sees only chats and tickets'=>'无限坐席，支持仅查看聊天和工单的“支持坐席”角色','Reply to tickets by email'=>'通过电子邮件回复工单','Knowledge base: articles, categories, search, and a KB section in the chat'=>'知识库：文章、类别、搜索以及聊天中的知识库模块','Saved replies, business hours, priorities and SLAs'=>'已保存的回复、营业时间、优先级和 SLA','Suggested replies, thread summaries and auto-tagging by AI'=>'AI 生成的建议回复、对话摘要和自动标记','Knowledge-gap report: the questions your site could not answer'=>'知识差距报告：您的网站无法回答的问题','Push notifications and an installable agent app for your phone'=>'推送通知以及适用于您手机的可安装代理应用程序','Proactive messages, reports, webhooks, Slack and Telegram alerts'=>'主动消息、报告、Webhook、Slack 和 Telegram 提醒','Zinn® Chat Pro'=>'Zinn® Chat Pro','From $%1$d a month or $%2$d a year for one site.'=>'单站点每月 $%1$d 起，或每年 $%2$d 起。','Try Pro free for 14 days'=>'免费试用 Pro 版 14 天','See plans'=>'查看方案','No card needed for the trial.'=>'试用无需绑定信用卡。','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'ChatGPT 的开发者。一个不错的全能助手。','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Claude 的开发者。擅长写作和严谨推理。','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google 的 Gemini 模型。快速且经济实惠。','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'