'Test'=>'测试','Remove'=>'移除','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'由更新的插件版本保存：请更新此插件，或重新输入密钥。','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'已保存的密钥无法再打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'已连接 — 上次测试通过 %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'上次测试失败：%s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'已连接 — 尚未测试','Which model to use'=>'使用哪个模型','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ 表示我们针对该任务的推荐。此列表包含您的密钥可使用的所有模型，实时读取自提供商。','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— 推荐服务商 —','Save models'=>'保存模型','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'从提供商处刷新模型列表','Images'=>'图像','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'连接 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图片。','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首家互联提供商的最新图像模型 —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'站点搜索（嵌入）','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter 以构建您网站的搜索索引。','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首个集成提供商的最新嵌入模型 —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'更改此项会重建所有使用它的插件的搜索索引。','best quality'=>'最高画质','lowest cost'=>'最低成本','fastest'=>'最快','Add a model yourself'=>'自行添加模型','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'今天发布了新模型？输入其准确名称即可直接使用。','Model name'=>'模型名称','Add model'=>'添加模型','Recommended models list'=>'推荐模型列表','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'无法验证推荐模型列表，因此未显示任何推荐。请重新安装插件，或在下方开启每日更新。','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'正在使用的列表发布于 %s。每次插件更新都会带来一个新的列表。','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'也请每天查看一次 Zinn Digital® 以获取更新的列表。','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'仅发送纯下载请求：不包含密钥、网站地址，也没有关于您内容的任何信息。该列表经过签名，签名检查未通过的列表将被忽略。','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'最后检查于 %1$s：%2$s。','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存，若已开启则立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装更新的列表','already up to date'=>'已是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® 无法访问；当前列表将继续使用','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看他们的状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开AI设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'对不起，您没有权限执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知提供商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'请输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像 API 密钥。请重新复制，不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的 API 密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'模型已保存。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'请输入该模型的准确名称，例如照抄提供商文档中的写法。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'模型已移除。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。将使用插件自带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已勾选：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的AI密钥已被某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或者在AI设置中重新输入该密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'未为此任务选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'当前版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'未连接能够生成图像的 AI 提供商。请在 AI 设置中添加 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 密钥。','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'此AI提供商无法生成图像。请在AI设置中选择OpenAI或Google Gemini以生成图像。','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'您的AI密钥无法使用任何图像模型。请向提供商检查密钥的权限，或为图像选择其他提供商。','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'没有已连接的 AI 提供商可以构建搜索索引。请在 AI 设置中添加一个 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter 密钥。','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'您的AI密钥无法使用任何嵌入模型。请向提供商检查密钥权限，或为站内搜索选择其他提供商。','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法构建搜索索引。请连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或兼容的服务以启用网站搜索。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'本网站无法连接到您的 AI 服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，以及您的网络服务器是否能够访问其地址（托管网站无法访问您本地计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'此网站无法访问 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果该服务正常运行，则可能是您的主机正在阻止出站连接，或者地址有误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 提示您的账户已无剩余额度或配额。请在其账户中添加额度或提高限制，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入错误、已被撤销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并将其粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了此密钥请求。此密钥可能无法访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'您的密钥无法从 %2$s 获取模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或通过他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 正在限制您的密钥发送请求的速度。请稍候一分钟再试，或者提高您与他们的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（对方服务器出现宕机或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请将以下详细信息提供给客服支持。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI 提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题持续存在，请选择其他模型或联系客服。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义（兼容 OpenAI）','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为此提供商保存密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥可用，但提供商未列出可用的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接。%1$s使用%2$s进行了回答。您的AI功能已准备就绪，可以使用。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不允许在本网站上使用人工智能。请联系管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 消费限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 请求配额上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高该配额。','Usage and cost'=>'使用情况和费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为近似值，根据已公布的价格计算；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 个请求，约 %2$s。','When'=>'时间','Who'=>'谁','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'模型','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发起任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'已完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月消费额度（US dollars）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空则不设限制。当近似费用达到此限额时，AI将在该月剩余时间内停止响应。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空则不设限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用 AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不勾选则允许所有能够使用该插件功能的人使用人工智能。管理员始终可以使用。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','Content'=>'内容','Not found.'=>'未找到。','%s joined the chat.'=>'%s 加入了聊天。','Type a reply first.'=>'请先输入回复。','The chat has ended. Thank you for contacting us.'=>'聊天已结束。感谢您联系我们。','You are chatting with the assistant again.'=>'您正在与助理重新聊天。','This conversation is now ticket #%d. We will reply by email.'=>'此对话现已转为工单 #%d。我们将通过电子邮件回复。','Type a question first.'=>'请先输入一个问题。','The whole site is being read again in the background.'=>'整个网站正在后台重新抓取。','Meanings are being rebuilt in the background.'=>'后台正在重建含义。','Submit a ticket form'=>'提交工单表单','Heading'=>'标题','Default subject'=>'默认主题','Button text'=>'按钮文本','Show the subject field (yes or no)'=>'显示主题字段（是或否）','My support requests'=>'我的支持请求','Chat button'=>'聊天按钮','Chat with us'=>'在线咨询','Support'=>'支持','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d. We have emailed you a link to follow it.'=>'谢谢。您的请求已被受理为工单 #%d。我们已向您发送了一封包含跟踪链接的电子邮件。','Your reply has been sent.'=>'您的回复已发送。','If there is a request under that address, we have emailed you a new link.'=>'如果该地址有相关请求，我们已向您发送了一封包含新链接的电子邮件。','Something went wrong. Please check the form and try again.'=>'发生了一些错误。请检查表单后重试。','Your message could not be sent.'=>'无法发送您的消息。','You are sending messages too quickly. Please wait a little and try again.'=>'您发送消息的速度过快。请稍候再试。','Please agree to the privacy notice to send your request.'=>'请同意隐私声明以发送您的请求。','Please complete the check to show you are not a robot.'=>'请完成验证以证明您不是机器人。','Sign in to see your support requests.'=>'请登录以查看您的支持请求。','Your name'=>'您的姓名','Your email'=>'您的电子邮箱','Subject'=>'主题','Which order is this about?'=>'这笔订单是关于哪一个的？','Not about an order'=>'与订单无关','How can we help?'=>'我们能为您做些什么？','Privacy policy'=>'隐私政策','Send request'=>'发送请求','All requests'=>'所有请求','Your support requests'=>'您的工单','You have no support requests yet.'=>'您目前没有任何支持请求。','Updated'=>'已更新','New request'=>'新请求','This link has expired. Enter your email address and we will send you a new one.'=>'此链接已失效。请输入您的电子邮件地址，我们将为您发送新链接。','This link is not valid. Enter your email address and we will send you a link to your requests.'=>'此链接无效。请输入您的电子邮件地址，我们将向您发送指向您请求的链接。','Email me a new link'=>'给我发一个新的链接','Request #%1$d: %2$s'=>'请求 #%1$d：%2$s','Status:'=>'状态：','Your reply'=>'您的回复','Send reply'=>'发送回复','You'=>'您','Submit a ticket'=>'提交工单','Add to Menu'=>'添加到菜单','Create the support page on the Zinn® Chat setup screen to add a "Submit a ticket" link.'=>'在 Zinn® Chat 设置屏幕上创建支持页面以添加“提交工单”链接。','[#%1$d] We have your request: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] 我们已收到您的请求：%2$s','Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request and will reply as soon as we can.'=>'感谢您的联系。我们已收到您的请求，并将尽快回复您。','View your request'=>'查看您的请求','[#%1$d] New ticket: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] 新工单：%2$s','Open the ticket'=>'打开工单','[#%1$d] New reply: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] 新回复：%2$s','You can reply on the page below.'=>'您可以在下方的页面上回复。','View and reply'=>'查看并回复','[#%1$d] Customer replied: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] 客户已回复：%2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%d'=>'访客正在聊天 #%d 中等待','A visitor asked to talk to a person and is waiting for an answer.'=>'访客请求与人工客服对话，目前正在等待回复。','Answer now'=>'立即回答','Your chat with %s'=>'您与 %s 的聊天','[#%d] Your link to your request'=>'[#%d] 您的请求链接','Here is a new link to your request. The old one no longer works.'=>'这是您请求的新链接。旧链接已失效。','From: %s'=>'发件人：%s','a visitor'=>'访客','Zinn® Chat chats and support tickets'=>'Zinn® Chat 聊天记录与支持工单','Chats'=>'聊天','Started'=>'已启动','Name'=>'名称','Email'=>'电子邮件','Page'=>'页面','Messages'=>'消息','Support tickets'=>'技术支持工单','Ticket'=>'工单','Opened'=>'已开启','When you use the chat or submit a support request, we store your messages, the name and email address you give us, the page you were on and a coded form of your IP address, so that we can answer you and keep a record of your request.'=>'当您使用聊天或提交支持请求时，我们会存储您的消息、您提供的姓名和电子电子邮件地址、您当时所在的页面以及您IP地址的编码形式，以便我们能够回复您并保留您的请求记录。','If our AI assistant answers you, your message and passages from this website are sent to the AI provider we use to produce the answer.'=>'如果我们的 AI 助手为您解答，您的消息以及本网站的相关段落将被发送至我们用于生成回答的 AI 提供商。','The chat is not available right now.'=>'目前无法使用聊天功能。','Please type a message.'=>'请输入一条消息。','Please agree to the privacy notice to start the chat.'=>'请同意隐私声明以开始聊天。','You have started too many chats today. Please try again tomorrow or send us a ticket.'=>'您今天发起的聊天次数过多。请于明天重试或向我们提交工单。','The chat could not be started. Please try again.'=>'无法启动聊天。请重试。','Nobody can answer in chat right now. Leave your email address and we will reply by email.'=>'当前无人在线回复。请留下您的电子邮件地址，我们将通过电子邮件回复您。','The assistant cannot answer right now. You can ask for a person or leave us a message.'=>'助理现在无法回答。您可以要求转接人工服务或给我们留言。','We are putting you through to a person. Please stay on this page.'=>'我们正在为您转接人工客服。请留在当前页面。','This chat has ended.'=>'此会话已结束。','Tickets are not available right now.'=>'目前没有可用的工单。','Visitor'=>'访客','Team'=>'团队','Chat so far:'=>'目前聊天记录：','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d and we will reply by email.'=>'谢谢。您的请求已生成工单 #%d，我们将通过电子邮件回复您。','Please enter a valid email address.